{"parse": {"text": {"*": "<html><body><tr><th style=\"text-align:right\">Roles:</th><td><a href=\"/dota2/Role#Carry\" title=\"Carry\"><img alt=\"Carry\" class=\"componentsinvert\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"23\" src=\"/commons/images/thumb/2/2f/Dota2_Filter_Carry_icon.png/28px-Dota2_Filter_Carry_icon.png\" srcset=\"/commons/images/thumb/2/2f/Dota2_Filter_Carry_icon.png/42px-Dota2_Filter_Carry_icon.png 1.5x, /commons/images/thumb/2/2f/Dota2_Filter_Carry_icon.png/56px-Dota2_Filter_Carry_icon.png 2x\" width=\"28\"/></a> <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/dota2/Role#Carry\" title=\"Role\">Carry</a> <a href=\"/dota2/Role#Durable\" title=\"Durable\"><img alt=\"Durable\" class=\"componentsinvert\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"23\" src=\"/commons/images/thumb/c/cf/Dota2_Filter_Durable_icon.png/28px-Dota2_Filter_Durable_icon.png\" srcset=\"/commons/images/thumb/c/cf/Dota2_Filter_Durable_icon.png/42px-Dota2_Filter_Durable_icon.png 1.5x, /commons/images/thumb/c/cf/Dota2_Filter_Durable_icon.png/56px-Dota2_Filter_Durable_icon.png 2x\" width=\"28\"/></a> <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/dota2/Role#Durable\" title=\"Role\">Durable</a> <a href=\"/dota2/Role#Initiator\" title=\"Initiator\"><img alt=\"Initiator\" class=\"componentsinvert\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"23\" src=\"/commons/images/thumb/e/ea/Dota2_Filter_Initiator_icon.png/28px-Dota2_Filter_Initiator_icon.png\" srcset=\"/commons/images/thumb/e/ea/Dota2_Filter_Initiator_icon.png/42px-Dota2_Filter_Initiator_icon.png 1.5x, /commons/images/thumb/e/ea/Dota2_Filter_Initiator_icon.png/56px-Dota2_Filter_Initiator_icon.png 2x\" width=\"28\"/></a> <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/dota2/Role#Initiator\" title=\"Role\">Initiator</a> <a href=\"/dota2/Role#Disabler\" title=\"Disabler\"><img alt=\"Disabler\" class=\"componentsinvert\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"23\" src=\"/commons/images/thumb/7/72/Dota2_Filter_Disabler_icon.png/28px-Dota2_Filter_Disabler_icon.png\" srcset=\"/commons/images/thumb/7/72/Dota2_Filter_Disabler_icon.png/42px-Dota2_Filter_Disabler_icon.png 1.5x, /commons/images/thumb/7/72/Dota2_Filter_Disabler_icon.png/56px-Dota2_Filter_Disabler_icon.png 2x\" width=\"28\"/></a> <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/dota2/Role#Disabler\" title=\"Role\">Disabler</a> <a href=\"/dota2/Role#Escape\" title=\"Escape\"><img alt=\"Escape\" class=\"componentsinvert\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"23\" src=\"/commons/images/thumb/0/09/Dota2_Filter_Escape_icon.png/28px-Dota2_Filter_Escape_icon.png\" srcset=\"/commons/images/thumb/0/09/Dota2_Filter_Escape_icon.png/42px-Dota2_Filter_Escape_icon.png 1.5x, /commons/images/thumb/0/09/Dota2_Filter_Escape_icon.png/56px-Dota2_Filter_Escape_icon.png 2x\" width=\"28\"/></a> <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/dota2/Role#Escape\" title=\"Role\">Escape</a> </td></tr><div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"Guardian_Sprint\">Guardian Sprint</h3><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/dota2/index.php?title=Slardar&amp;action=edit&amp;section=9\" title=\"Edit section: Guardian Sprint\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div><div class=\"spellcard-wrapper\"><div class=\"spelldesc\">Grants an additional bonus slow resistance upon cast.The slow resistance value decays linearly over the buff duration.</div></div><div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"Slithereen_Crush\">Slithereen Crush</h3><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/dota2/index.php?title=Slardar&amp;action=edit&amp;section=10\" title=\"Edit section: Slithereen Crush\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div><div class=\"spellcard-wrapper\"><div class=\"spelldesc\">Creates a water-based terrain that grant bonuses to certain abilities of Slardar's.</div></div><div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"Corrosive_Haze\">Corrosive Haze</h3><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/dota2/index.php?title=Slardar&amp;action=edit&amp;section=12\" title=\"Edit section: Corrosive Haze\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div><div class=\"spellcard-wrapper\"><div class=\"spelldesc\">The affected enemy unit leaves a trail of puddles behind it. Certain abilities of Slardar's considers this as a water-based terrain.</div></div></body></html>"}, "wikitext": {"*": ""}}}